<title>USA: BNN, Interpublic form marketing unit.</title>
<headline>BNN, Interpublic form marketing unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNN Corp said Monday it formed a unit with Interpublic Group of Cos Inc to handle sports and event marketing for General Motors Corp.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it formed the unit, Kaleidoscope Sports &amp; Entertainment LLC, through a joint venture it has with Interpublic.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said BNN expected the unit's account with car maker to total more than $10 million in 1997.</p>
</text>
